    "canonical_ref": "GregThaum.EpCan.3.s2",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "especially because it is universally reported, that they do not sacrifice to idols; nor shall those women who have been ravished by them, be treated as guilty of fornication, unless they were before of lewd lives.",
